                  <msItem>
                     <title>Ivo Carnotensis, Panormia</title>
                     <note type="MLGB3_generalNotes">Hereford Cathedral, MS O.ii.4, Oxford, All
                        Souls College, MS 82 and Jesus College, MS 26 are inscribed 'Liber Magistri
                        Aluredi', s. xii/xiii (?).</note>
                     <note type="MLGB3_generalNotes">A note of contents inked over appears to be in
                        Sir John Prise's hand. A similar note occurs in 13 other MSS, at Jesus, ten
                        of them from Cirencester and three of unknown provenance. The probability
                        that O.ii.4 is also from Ciencester is confirmed by the inscriptions in the
                        All Soul MS (q.v.): see also Hereford O.ii.4.</note>
                  </msItem>
               </msContents>
