                        Augustinian abbey of St Mary the Virgin</orgName><p>'Liber Magistri
                        Aluredi' in red capitals on the flyleaf, as in Hereford Cathedral O.ii.4 and
                        Oxford, All Souls College, MS 82.</p></provenance>
                  <provenance type="MLGB3_laterOwners">Sir John Prise (d. 1555).</provenance>
